%% STATUS: IMPLEMENTED for text documents (2026-11-05, branch platform-phases).
sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Knowledge editor
  actor AP as Approver
  participant UI as Knowledge admin UI
  participant API as Knowledge API
  participant ING as Ingestion pipeline
  participant EM as Embedding provider
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant AU as Audit log
  A->>UI: Upload official document and metadata
  UI->>API: POST /api/knowledge/documents
  API->>API: Check role, file type, size
  API->>ING: Start
  ING->>ING: Extract, normalize, flag instruction-like text
  ING->>ING: Chunk and hash
  ING->>EM: Embed chunks
  EM-->>ING: Vectors
  ING->>DB: Save version, status pending_review
  API->>AU: Record upload
  AP->>UI: Review extracted content and source
  alt Approver differs from uploader and approves
    UI->>API: POST approve
    API->>DB: Status approved, set effective date
    API->>DB: Supersede previous version
    API->>AU: Record approval and publication
  else Rejected
    UI->>API: POST reject with reason
    API->>DB: Status rejected
    API->>AU: Record rejection
  end
